<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Shelly" data-copy-zh="Shelly">Shelly</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Gift Shop access, the complete Sea Shell catalogue and shared island visits." data-copy-zh="礼品店入口、完整海贝壳商品与海岛共同探访。">Gift Shop access, the complete Sea Shell catalogue and shared island visits.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Vacation_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Collecting_Sea_Shells"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk_and_Relationship_Progress"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Getting_to_Her_Shop"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Shelly — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/shelly.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Shelly — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/shelly.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Shelly — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Shelly is the fixed shopkeeper at Sirena Isle’s Gift Shop. Spend Sea Shells on combat and management rewards; ordinary Gold and Shelly affection are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Reach Sirena Isle through Marina’s completed boat project, then visit the Gift Shop 08:00–21:00. Shelly and the browse action use that window. She does not need a vacation assignment.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Portrait hours</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Sirena Isle Gift Shop</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">08:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Collect Sea Shells from eligible resort activities, open the shop and choose the reward that fits your current needs. Equip worker or maid purchases on the intended character. Queenstone’s Snail Slime service only appears after you own Queenstone.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Gift_Shop_Purchases"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Sirena Isle Gift Shop</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 50/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Talk takes 20 minutes, gives 1 base affection and permits 50 positive daily uses. The shop does not award Shelly affection or NPC intimacy experience when you buy something. She has no personal H2H or romance action to unlock by increasing affection.</p><p>Eleven one-time shared Gift Shop encounters use active vacationing companions: Elara, Sophie, Shadow, Valkyra, Jade, Pixie, Brandy, Audrey, Sashimi, Maize and Pepper. Visit 08:00–21:00 while the relevant worker is active and on vacation. The scene does not need that worker to win the random resort portrait selection; its explanations remain in the game.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: complete Sea Shell catalogue</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Purchase</th><th scope="col">Sea Shells</th><th scope="col">Effect / repeatability</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Sirena Vibes</th><td data-label="Sea Shells">50</td><td data-label="Effect / repeatability">equipped worker: Loyalty cannot fall, +1/day up to 150; repeatable copies</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Claw</th><td data-label="Sea Shells">50</td><td data-label="Effect / repeatability">monster Taming cap 150; one copy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Heart of the Ocean</th><td data-label="Sea Shells">75</td><td data-label="Effect / repeatability">max Health, Energy and Calm each +50; one copy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ocean Fragrance</th><td data-label="Sea Shells">60</td><td data-label="Effect / repeatability">Neutral NPC affection random upper bound +1; one copy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Jock Shell</th><td data-label="Sea Shells">50</td><td data-label="Effect / repeatability">effective armor level +1; one copy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Poseidon Trident</th><td data-label="Sea Shells">100</td><td data-label="Effect / repeatability">physical attacks: 15% chance of 2× damage; one copy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mermaid Magic</th><td data-label="Sea Shells">100</td><td data-label="Effect / repeatability">combat spells: 15% chance of 2× damage; one copy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sea's Approval</th><td data-label="Sea Shells">60</td><td data-label="Effect / repeatability">equipped maid: Decor +1 and Promotion +1; one copy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pearl Necklace</th><td data-label="Sea Shells">120</td><td data-label="Effect / repeatability">equipped worker: daily clients +2, income 2×; one copy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Snail Slime</th><td data-label="Sea Shells">10</td><td data-label="Effect / repeatability">owned Queenstone level +1; repeatable, no daily cap</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Desktop: hold Shift on Snail Slime to buy the maximum affordable number of levels. Check the displayed total before buying. It upgrades your owned Queenstone immediately.</p></details><p>Each of the eleven shared shop events gives 3 base completion affection to Shelly and the companion; replies add 4 or 5 base to each. Completion also uses the resort’s Sea Shell reward roll. Ocean Fragrance raises the upper random affection bound for Neutral NPCs; it does not raise the relationship cap or guarantee a point every time. Shelly herself is Good.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: affection bonuses</summary><p>Each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 before ordinary affection bonuses; the favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct rewards remain the listed direct amount. An affinity is not itself a lesson offered by this character.</p><p>Commerce 88; Charm 84; Creativity 86</p><p>Favorite skill: Appraisal</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Costs are base values; applicable skills and active bonuses may change them. Base affection, direct affection, player experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate. Conversation choices can add rewards beyond event-completion affection.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><p>Having Gold does not pay the Sea Shell price. Owned one-copy rewards remain visible but unavailable. Snail Slime raises the existing Queenstone’s level; it does not obtain the stone, consume it or use a daily allowance. Heart of the Ocean increases maximum bars, not a promised current-bar refill.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships and affection</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Skills</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Locations</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Sirena Isle access and Sea Shells</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Soul Stones</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-maid-system.html">Maid equipment</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Vacation_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Collecting_Sea_Shells"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk_and_Relationship_Progress"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Getting_to_Her_Shop"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Shelly 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/shelly.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Shelly 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/shelly.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Shelly 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Shelly 是塞壬岛礼品店的常驻店主。这里用海贝壳换取战斗与经营奖励，普通金钱和 Shelly 的好感度分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><p>通过 Marina 已完成的船只项目抵达塞壬岛，再于 08:00–21:00 拜访礼品店。Shelly 肖像与浏览商店行动都使用此时段，她本人不需要安排度假。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">肖像在场时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">塞壬岛礼品店</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">08:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>通过符合条件的度假活动取得海贝壳，再打开商店购买目前需要的奖励。员工或女仆装备要装到对应角色身上才会生效。女王石的蜗牛黏液服务只有持有女王石后才会出现。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Gift_Shop_Purchases"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">塞壬岛礼品店</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 50次/日</td></tr></tbody></table><p>交谈耗时 20 分钟，增加 1 基础好感度，每天有 50 次正面使用机会。购买商品不会增加 Shelly 好感度或 NPC 亲密经验。提高好感度不会额外开放个人谈心或恋爱行动。</p><p>礼品店有十一项一次性共同事件，对应 Elara、Sophie、Shadow、Valkyra、Jade、Pixie、Brandy、Audrey、Sashimi、Maize 与 Pepper。要求对应员工在职且正在度假，并于 08:00–21:00 到访；不必等该员工被随机抽中显示为度假肖像。事件内容请在游戏中体验。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：完整海贝壳商品表</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">购买项目</th><th scope="col">海贝壳</th><th scope="col">效果／购买次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Sirena风情</th><td data-label="海贝壳">50</td><td data-label="效果／购买次数">装备员工：忠诚不再下降，每日 +1，最高 150；可重复购买</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">利爪</th><td data-label="海贝壳">50</td><td data-label="效果／购买次数">怪物驯服度上限 150；单件</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海洋之心</th><td data-label="海贝壳">75</td><td data-label="效果／购买次数">生命、精力与镇定上限各 +50；单件</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海洋香氛</th><td data-label="海贝壳">60</td><td data-label="效果／购买次数">中立 NPC 好感度随机上界 +1；单件</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">护身贝甲</th><td data-label="海贝壳">50</td><td data-label="效果／购买次数">有效护甲等级 +1；单件</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">波塞冬三叉戟</th><td data-label="海贝壳">100</td><td data-label="效果／购买次数">物理攻击：15% 概率造成 2 倍伤害；单件</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">人鱼魔法</th><td data-label="海贝壳">100</td><td data-label="效果／购买次数">战斗法术：15% 概率造成 2 倍伤害；单件</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海之认可</th><td data-label="海贝壳">60</td><td data-label="效果／购买次数">装备女仆：装饰 +1、宣传等级 +1；单件</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">珍珠项链</th><td data-label="海贝壳">120</td><td data-label="效果／购买次数">装备员工：每日客人 +2、收入 2 倍；单件</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">蜗牛黏液</th><td data-label="海贝壳">10</td><td data-label="效果／购买次数">现有女王石等级 +1；可重复，无每日次数上限</td></tr></tbody></table><p>桌面版购买蜗牛黏液时可按住 Shift，一次购买当前海贝壳负担得起的最多等级；购买前请检查显示的总价。服务会立即升级持有的女王石。</p></details><p>十一项共同商店事件各给予 Shelly 与同行角色 3 基础完成好感度，回复再各加 4 或 5 基础好感度；完成时也使用度假村的海贝壳奖励判定。海洋香氛提高中立 NPC 的随机好感度上界，不提高关系上限，也不保证每次额外加一点；Shelly 本人为善良阵营。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：好感度加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。直接奖励仍按标明的直接数值加入。偏好技能本身不代表该角色会教授它。</p><p>商业 88; 魅力 84; 创造力 86</p><p>偏好技能：鉴定</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。消耗为基础值，适用技能与当前加成可能改变实际数值。基础好感度、直接好感度、玩家经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算；对话选择可能在事件完成好感度之外追加奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>常见卡点</h2><p>金钱不能支付海贝壳价格。已持有的单件商品仍会显示，但不可重复购买。蜗牛黏液提升现有女王石等级，不会取得新石头、不消耗石头，也没有每日次数。海洋之心增加各项上限，不保证回满当前数值。</p></section>
